            "notes": "Round 2 \u2013 $6,750\n\nItems: [Crusader\u2019s Cure](item_e89b853c-2441-432b-b4eb-20bc4b1b0619)\n\nNotes: Crusader\u2019s Cure is essential vs Ana anti-nade and Brig stuns. Combined with Stampede, this starts showing the anti-anti direction: cleanse + engage. Keep in mind I usually get anywhere from 15-17k after first round so I have a lot of extra money, if you do to you can pack it into survivability or into ability power such as [Boost Recycler](item_97a47dab-4554-4340-a9ef-f9424210e08b) it's worth noting that if they do have a [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768) you can always grab [Ironclad Cleats](item_afb5c28e-3980-4a7d-85be-785c32217c28)\n\nIf they do NOT have an [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or an [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) take [Ironclad Cleats](item_afb5c28e-3980-4a7d-85be-785c32217c28) instead to face off against the [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) or [Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768). This also helps with [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317) kicks.",
